#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/dogs-of-war.adoc:137
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/regiments-of-renown.adoc:251
msgid ""
"The pike is the traditional weapon of the mercenaries of Tilea. Twice as "
"long as a spear and even longer than a cavalryman’s lance this is a truly "
"fearsome although rather unwieldy weapon."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/dogs-of-war.adoc:141
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/regiments-of-renown.adoc:255
msgid ""
"Pikemen are based facing the short edge of the base in the same way as "
"Cavalry, rather than the long edge like other Infantry."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/dogs-of-war.adoc:148
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/regiments-of-renown.adoc:262
msgid ""
"Pikemen can not enter dense terrain (even partially). They still may be in a "
"defended position on higher ground or behind a low obstacle as usual, but "
"can only claim defended status when fighting to the front. An enemy does not "
"receive charge bonuses when charging Pikemen in the front, nor do Pikemen "
"receive any charge bonus themselves."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/dogs-of-war.adoc:152
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/regiments-of-renown.adoc:266
msgid ""
"A Pikemen stand cannot support or be supported by other infantry - only by "
"other Pikemen stands. In all other respects they count as infantry (movement/"
"pursuit etc.)."
msgstr ""

